arbeitnow:software-engineer-front-end-st:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Clear Street&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Clear Street’s mission is to give every sophisticated investor access to every asset, in every market, through a unified platform built for speed, transparency and scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;We give our clients the technology, tools, and service once reserved for the largest institutions, rebuilt with modern infrastructure. Our single, cloud-native, end-to-end capital markets platform powers investor growth today and is transforming how they can interact with markets tomorrow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href="https://clearstreet.io/"&gt;https://clearstreet.io&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer (Front-End)\, you will help build our flagship Clear Street Studio, a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;modern prime brokerage experience. You will tackle non-trivial problems that force you to balance &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;trade-offs while implementing clean and efficient solutions. You will raise our bar on delivering solutions &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;that delight and offer the best experience for our customers, and you will push our operational &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;standards to ensure we can offer and maintain a high SLA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;This role is deeply involved in engineering the next generation of our state-of-the-art Studio (portal) for &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;a varied client base including hedge funds, traders, and portfolio managers. As a senior member of the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;team, you will set technical direction, mentor other engineers, and own significant parts of the platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;end to end.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;• Lead the design and delivery of complex, user-facing features and shared foundations for Clear &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Street Studio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;• Drive a system-design approach to building new front-end services, balancing trade-offs across &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;scale, performance, and maintainability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;• Set and evolve engineering standards across the Studio Core team, including architecture, testing, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;tooling, and code quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;• Mentor and grow other engineers through code review, pairing, and technical guidance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;• Partner with product, design, and back-end leads to shape roadmaps and turn ambiguous problems &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;into clear technical plans.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;• Own the operational excellence of your domains, ensuring reliability, observability, and a high SLA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;• Clearly explain the nuances of system design and front-end paradigms to engineers and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;stakeholders alike.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;The Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;You will join the Studio Core front-end team, a group of talented, passionate and highly collaborative &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;engineers who own the foundations of the Clear Street Studio experience. Working together, we have &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;built a platform that serves institutional clients and is at the forefront of technological innovation. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Our engineers take pride not just in the value we provide our customers, but in the quality of our work. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;As a member of our team, you will work with cutting-edge technologies, collaborate with colleagues &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;from diverse backgrounds, and make a meaningful impact on the financial industry. We value creativity, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;innovation, and a strong work ethic, and we are committed to providing our team members with the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;support and resources they need to succeed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Tech Stack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;React, TypeScript, Next.js, Module Federation, Nx, Node.js, Kubernetes, and Cloud (AWS or Azure).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;• At least six (6) years of professional experience implementing scalable web applications with React &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;and TypeScript.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;• Experience contributing to systems that solve complex business problems and handle massive &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;amounts of data; you are drawn towards scale, distributed systems, and associated technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;• A strong command of design patterns, data structures, and algorithms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;• The ability to clearly explain the nuances of system design and paradigms to engineers and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;• A track record of prioritizing end-user experience, reflected in your API design, functionality, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;• Demonstrated ability to mentor team members, define engineering standards, and drive a system- &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;design approach to building new services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;• Excellent communication and collaboration skills, with a consistent focus on delivering high-quality &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;• Pride in the quality of your work and a high standard for what you ship.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;• Experience leading front-end architecture for large-scale or data-intensive applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;• Deep experience with monorepo tooling (Nx, Turborepo) and micro-frontend architectures such as &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Module Federation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;• Hands-on experience with Kubernetes, CI/CD pipelines, and cloud platforms (AWS or Azure).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;• Experience in financial services, capital markets, or trading platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;What We Offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;At Clear Street, we offer competitive compensation packages, company equity, pension, gender-neutral &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;parental leave, and full medical and dental insurance. Our belief has always been that we are better as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;business when we are all together in person. As such, we require employees to be in the office a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;minimum of three days per week. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Our top priority is our people. We’re continuously investing in a culture that promotes collaboration. We &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;help each other through challenges and celebrate each other’s successes. We believe that modern &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;workplaces succeed by virtue of having high-performance workforces that are diverse in ideas, in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;cultures, and in experiences. We put in the effort to make such a workplace a daily reality and are proud &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;to be an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>
